# Prophet Live intraday evaluator — the product lane (masterplan §4.2a). GitHub's
# scheduler throttles this repo's frequent crons far past the documented 15-45 min
# (measured 2026-07-30: a */5 lane ran 09:07Z then 12:19Z, ~3h12m apart), so the
# 5-minute cadence lives here and .github/workflows/prophet-live.yml is the backstop.
#
# The pass reads the box's own quote plane off disk, evaluates the nightly armed pack,
# publishes to R2 and writes the served copy at
# /var/lib/macro-live/public/live/prophet_live.json by atomic rename. It writes no
# data/ path and runs no git command (LEDGER LAW G0.2).
#
# RESOURCE CAPS ARE MEASURED, not guessed (2026-07-30, production-shaped inputs: a
# 1,742-name pack and the real 2,025-symbol quote snapshot):
#   compute      0.006 s wall / 0.006 s CPU per pass for the whole state machine
#   process      0.32 s wall / 0.30 s CPU for a stand-down tick (start + imports + yaml)
#   boto3        0.29 s wall / 0.21 s CPU / 66.6 MB RSS for import + client build
#   peak RSS     ~95 MB all-in (28.5 MB of data structures + the boto3 closure)
#   wall clock   dominated by 2-4 R2 round trips, not by compute
# So: MemoryHigh 256M is ~2.7x the measured peak and MemoryMax 512M a hard stop at
# ~5x — a third of the smallest sibling lane's ceiling, on a 2-vCPU box with thin burst
# headroom. CPUQuota 60% cannot starve the tape lanes it depends on (fast 180%,
# snapshot 90%) yet is ~350x the CPU a pass actually spends; it exists to bound a
# runaway, not the work. Nice/CPUWeight/IOWeight sit in the `bars` tier — the LOWEST
# on the box, deliberately: this lane consumes what the quote lanes publish, so it must
# always lose a scheduling contest with them. TimeoutStartSec 120 bounds a wedged R2
# call well inside the 300 s timer period, so two passes can never overlap.
[Unit]
Description=Mastermind Prophet Live intraday provisional-close evaluator
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/opt/macro
EnvironmentFile=-/etc/macro-live.env
ExecStart=/opt/macro/.venv/bin/python -m scripts.prophet_live_evaluator
TimeoutStartSec=120
Nice=10
CPUWeight=20
CPUQuota=60%
MemoryHigh=256M
MemoryMax=512M
IOWeight=20
NoNewPrivileges=true
PrivateTmp=true

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
